First close call of the wide20 account (8be1fb2f, 06:53): NEAR/USD
ABSORPTION_RECLAIM passed every gate and the line read NO_ELIGIBLE_SIZE_ON_LADDER
[NO_BOUNDED_FEASIBLE_LOT x3] — three rungs, one word each, not the constraint
that bound any of them. The ladder records each rung's binding; the decision
holds the ask and the stop. The line now prints `fraction: reason <- binding`
per rung and ask / stop / target. Log line only; refusal and recording
unchanged. judge/*.js re-pinned (§4.46).

